{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6b760d9a8eeea21fa60c52fc927aec66208bbb284b1044189051e672f0ab8b5a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7bbbdba55f0c89ce72df577b95c9d1879b35482e9266522bd421e3ccc14e2",
      "text": "小小聚餐会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d59dab2d5d0afdf68e54287ded051298946094f3511c81104ad4f0d3e4999d62",
      "text": "某天的碰头会前。克里斯找想乐和\n制作人商量，雨彦生日时要不要办点什么。\n面对询问具体想做什么的想乐，克里斯提议\n举办一场小小的派对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7bbbdba55f0c89ce72df577b95c9d1879b35482e9266522bd421e3ccc14e2",
      "text": "小小聚餐会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c37d9624085e5b6819a34b0437f78448d320f37866b9b27d1fa1eb368f1e83e",
      "text": "辛苦啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa4d40e2eb6acd36a22f8bd9a2d4847cf95720f8bc06aa5a2787eb41adf8e84",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:127ea4087345b336dad3e481b4feacf632d37ff2c178cca4fd1936bfe760067b",
      "text": "辛苦了！等大家都到齐了，我们再开始碰头会。\n到时间之前请随意休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2642a8b9e57a5b1899c5b741fc30a4ccb2bbc7070f0d2d2f3b54c3d92e20c801",
      "text": "哈……说起来马上就是雨彦的生日了呢！\n一年一度的重要日子。不做点什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5515e8201193dac4d19a87da264db1449dbd76bec02ac4f310d304fc08c0f1",
      "text": "克里斯先生，\n想做什么样的事呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e030768d42e620070e4e4f95b3169d864ef803936098e6410178caa45a3ca3d0",
      "text": "我想办个小小的派对！\n因为大家之前也为我庆祝过了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d838701ba173cca9b8583af9fdc072ceb1d0dc2ca60e6a70c5e53f834ebed848",
      "text": "像克里斯先生生日会那样的感觉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fccfa94e03d9a002e8b7f83b2f100e084b7e349f8aa424941ded20db91927be5",
      "text": "（那个规模的话，\n对我们现在的关系来说刚刚好呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf419f752d921f8e2d4ebfeb9bb61e3f4c4263c810a7ebc5fbb908d03f125840",
      "text": "嗯～，我觉得挺好～。就按要办的方向定吧～。\n剩下的之后再说。雨彦先生也差不多该来了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6de9962c14714ca72db109e957fb380f1cc5cb42c0729a5299485f609412b9e4",
      "text": "辛苦啦，大家在聊什么呢。\n好像听到了我的名字啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e45c075a7308cc29aa67f43875500c714881fa2a04213eb0d3fd6a6649de89",
      "text": "只是在聊雨彦先生怎么还没来呢～而已哦～。\n对吧～，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8874391563d3abfa3d88bea1f279100d1d0d977f24e65ecd0fffe2efd81d8f5",
      "text": "是的！既然大家都到齐了，\n虽然稍微早了点，我们就开始碰头会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
